{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>He Who Watches</strong> is an atmospheric first-person puzzle game about spatial reasoning and shifts in perspective. Walk on walls and ceilings in first person, using every surface and every flash of inspiration to solve mind-bending environmental puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070500/extras/f55849b0eccbb286c060f04f6a0f4b50.poster.avif?t=1774973732\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070500/extras/f55849b0eccbb286c060f04f6a0f4b50.webm?t=1774973732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070500/extras/f55849b0eccbb286c060f04f6a0f4b50.mp4?t=1774973732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with your trusty bow, a single arrow, and your wits, you must delve deep into a labyrinth of intricate conundrums, seeking the god at the centre of it all. Your bow is not a weapon. It is a tool, used to manipulate your environment and open the doors that lead you ever further inward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070500/extras/b75dfc3f28c294c29273d7ef6261917d.poster.avif?t=1774973732\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070500/extras/b75dfc3f28c294c29273d7ef6261917d.webm?t=1774973732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070500/extras/b75dfc3f28c294c29273d7ef6261917d.mp4?t=1774973732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk on walls. Walk on ceilings. Shift gravity as you slip between these planes, creating chain reactions to unlock the path forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070500/extras/e4e3d2d2609a18c1c5feecb3b43ddf11.poster.avif?t=1774973732\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070500/extras/e4e3d2d2609a18c1c5feecb3b43ddf11.webm?t=1774973732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070500/extras/e4e3d2d2609a18c1c5feecb3b43ddf11.mp4?t=1774973732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The labyrinth is fair, but it is also merciless. Expect no quarter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070500/extras/26338b35240647f791dc6d1f59521516.poster.avif?t=1774973732\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070500/extras/26338b35240647f791dc6d1f59521516.webm?t=1774973732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070500/extras/26338b35240647f791dc6d1f59521516.mp4?t=1774973732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by solo developer Bobby Vanden</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Published by puzzle specialists Draknek &amp; Friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve over 100 handcrafted 